# Environment

# Secrets never committed. Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides.

# M16 uses in-process local TF-IDF semantic fallback (no API key required).
# Hosted embeddings / pgvector remain optional future infrastructure — not required for ASK RUNTIME.

# The canonical public origin, with no trailing slash. Read at BUILD time, so changing it
# requires a rebuild/redeploy.
#
# Unset (the default) keeps every URL relative: no invented production host ships before
# launch. Set it at deploy (M26) or `pnpm smoke:live` will report a relative canonical, a
# social card pointing at localhost, and a sitemap with no absolute URLs.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
